  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">L5-105 Carbon Roots entreprenurial support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">L5-105 Carbon Roots entrepren&#xf6;rsst&#xf6;d</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;retaget koncentrar sin verksamhet kring bildandet av kol fr&#xe5;n biomassa avfall fr&#xe5;n jordbruk. Produkten som bildas &quot;char&quot; anv&#xe4;nds som   b&#xe4;nsle till matlagning och som ett h&#xe5;llbart jordf&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttring&#xe4;ndring medel. Den sociala verksamheten genererar int&#xe4;kter genom f&#xf6;rs&#xe4;ljning  av gr&#xf6;na tr&#xe4;kol briketter, och &#xf6;kar markens kvalitet och dess         gr&#xf6;dorgenom biochar produktion och utdelning till jordbrukare. Avtalspart &#xe4;r Carbon Roots International (CRI), org.nr EIN (USA): 27-3805576, USA.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The social enterprise venture is centered around the creation of carbon-rich char from sustainable and renewable agricultural waste    biomass. This char is then promoted as cooking fuel and as a sustainable soil amendment. The social business earns income through  the sale of green charcoal briquettes, and increases soil health and  crop yields through biochar production and disbursal to farmers. Agreement partner is Carbon Roots International (CRI), org reg no EIN (USA): 27-3805576, USA.</narrative>
  </description>
